    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1284" root="أَمَتْ" body-key="A">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آمَتْ</span></b> , (S, * M, K, [in the CK, erroneously,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">آمَتْ</span>,]) second pers. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَوْتِ</span>; (S;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمِيَتْ</span>, (M,
K,) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمِعَتْ</span>; (K;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمُوَتْ</span>, (Lh, M, K,)
like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرُمَتٌ</span>; (K;) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمُوَّةٌ</span>; (S, M, K;)
<i>She</i> (a woman) <i>became a slave;</i> (S, * M, K;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأَمَّتْ</span></b> . (Msb.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمَتِ السِّنَّوْرُ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأْمُو</span>,
inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمَآءٌ</span>, <i>The cat</i> [<i>mewed,</i> or] <i>uttered a cry;</i>
(S, K;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآءَ تْ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمُوْءُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُوَآءٌ</span>. (S.)

